@startuml
title State diagram of Plane Management System

[*] --> Order

state "Order" as Order
state "Arrival" as Arrival
state "Preparation" as Preparation
state "Operations" as Operations
state "Maintenance" as Maintenance
state "Out of Service" as OutOfService

Order --> Arrival : Delivered

Arrival --> Preparation : Arrived

Preparation --> Operations : Ready for Operations
Preparation --> Maintenance : Requires Maintenance

Operations --> Operations : Scheduled Flights
Operations --> Maintenance : No Scheduled Flights or Maintenance Required

Maintenance --> Preparation : Serviced and Ready

Preparation --> OutOfService : No longer available

Operations --> OutOfService : Permanently Withdrawn

@enduml
